WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:06,960
Mahan

2
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,180
Brother Zhang Long

3
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:13,580
Why are you here? Ma Han, this is my boss.

4
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,420
Because there is a shortage of manpower to rectify Cao Yun

5
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,560
I'll bring him to you, Brother Zhang Long

6
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,800
How much money can I give you this month?

7
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,850
Twenty years per person per month

8
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:30,010
Will you accept a cripple like me? How about my martial arts?

9
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:32,210
Brother Ma Jie’s martial arts skills are absolutely nothing to say

10
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:33,290
And it’s a cross

11
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,250
If he hadn't been shot in the knee by a northern barbarian,

12
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,090
Now it's a centurion

13
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,450
if you want

14
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,010
From now on, my master Cao Yun will be the Security Brigade

15
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,610
I'll leave it to you to take responsibility

16
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:48,810
How about I give you thirty taels per month?
